Step 1. validateAuth(auth, "depositor"). If not authorized, return an error.

Step 2. library = selectLibraryRegistration(submission.library_id).

If library is null, return an error.

Step 3. validationResult = validateEntry(submission.entry_fields, library.library_schema).

If invalid, return an error with the validation details.

Step 4. entryId = generateEntryId().

Set the submission fields: entry_id, deposit_date, depositor_id, depositor_affiliation, moderation_status pending, version 1.

Step 5. insertEntry(submission).

Step 6. updateAliasIndex.

Step 7. insertProvenance.

Step 8. insertAuditLog.

Step 9. return the entry_id and the status submitted.

