Validation Engine Design
The service validates the following:

Validation 1. Library registration validity. Every registration is validated against the library registration schema.

Validation 2. Entry validity. Every entry is validated against the library schema for its library.

Validation 3. Query validity. Every query is validated against the lookup query schema.

Validation 4. Referential integrity. Every entry's library_id must resolve to a registered library.

Validation 5. Version chain acyclicity. The version chain must be acyclic.

Validation 6. Provenance completeness. Every entry must have a provenance record.

Validation 7. Audit completeness. Every operation must have an audit log entry.

Validation 8. Moderation completeness. Every entry must have a moderation record.

Validation 9. Alias index consistency. The alias index must reflect the current entries.

